OL,3,GNEWSAGroundsman blows final whistle on
OL,4,A47-year career
OL,5,
OL,6,FA groundsman who has spent nearly five
OL,7,Fdecades maintaining professional
OL,8,Ffootball pitches in Stoke-on-Trent is
OL,9,Fset to retire.
OL,11,FSteve Speed, who worked at Port Vale
OL,12,Ffor 43-and-a-half years before joining
OL,13,FStoke City four years ago, is stepping
OL,14,Fdown after turning 65 on Monday.
OL,16,FHe said he would feel "a bit sad" to
OL,17,Fleave the job but that the "aches and
OL,18,Fpains" had increased in recent years.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
