OL,3,GNEWSAGroundsman blows final whistle on
OL,4,A47-year career
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm lucky though, I've done a job that
OL,7,FI've really enjoyed," he said, adding
OL,8,F"everybody has bad days at work, but I
OL,9,Fthink I've probably had half a dozen".
